<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 19 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 2100, tin up 20, lead up 150, zinc up 12200, aluminium down 2250, nickel down 234, aluminium alloy down 120</p>
</text>
